      "code": "DLVu84XSWyF",
      "title": "Everything related to Alex Scott- as a former Bristolian, I am glad to know this talented young star from his first match at Ashton Gate. His amazing skills and attitude attracts me immediately, and we’ve got so many lovely chances to chat- about football, about future, about life. It’s definitely my honour to know Scotty not only as an amazing player, but a fantastic person. It’s also my honour to have his match-worn shirt and boots gifted by him. As now capped for England U21 to the final, I wish him the best of luck, and I will support him as I always do, as one of the few supporters of Scotty from his first game. Even now moved to NYC, I am trying to watch all games Scott are playing, and hope we could meet each other soon!",
